             ["ts-drawing", "The transition state holds what the rate law holds: bimolecular (bi-) SN2 and E2 contain the nucleophile or base, while the unimolecular (uni-) SN1 ionization contains the substrate alone, with delta plus on carbon and delta minus on the leaving group."]
